  ctx.shadow,           // ShadowConfig | null
  "inbox-promote",      // operation name (used in commit message)
  taskSlug,             // ref (optional - item identifier)
  "detail",             // detail (optional - extra context)
);
```

**commitIfShadow signature:**
```typescript
